        "text": "<p>Choose Affirm at checkout to split your purchase into monthly payments.</p>",
        "show_as_low_as": true,
        "secondary_text": "<p>Prefer pre-tax dollars? Eligible riders save an average of 30% with HSA/FSA via Truemed.</p>",
